  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to fight AIDS,Tuberculosis and Malaria 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-year contribution to The Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria for a total of NOK 2 billion for the period 2023-2025.

The Global Fund is a worldwide partnership to defeat HIV, TB and malaria and ensure a healthier, safer, more equitable future for all. They raise and invest more than USD 5 billion a year to fight the three diseases, challenge the injustice that fuels them, and strengthen health systems and pandemic preparedness in more than 100 of the hardest hit countries.</narrative>
  </description>
